  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you prepare this plan, you can designate an additional function of a trinket you have created (or will create, if you possess the Secret Project talent) as a nebulous function.</p>\n<p>A nebulous function has no benefit, except that you or the trinket's user can reveal this plan as a swift or immediate action to replace the nebulous function with a function you could add to the trinket, making any checks or paying any costs when revealed. Regardless of who reveals the plan, it counts towards your prepared plans.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/artifice#toc23\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
